---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base title="About" description="About AI Virtual Assistant Co, an AI-assisted virtual assistant service for small businesses run by Kevin Britz." path="about/">
<div class="wrap read page-body"><h1>About</h1>
<p>AI Virtual Assistant Co is an AI-assisted virtual assistant service for small businesses, run by Kevin Britz.</p><p>The site is new. We do not list clients, testimonials, results or statistics because we have none we can verify and share. As that changes, we will add them only with their source.</p><p>See <a href={withBase("services/")}>services</a>, <a href={withBase("disclosure/")}>Disclosure</a> and <a href={withBase("contact/")}>Request a quote</a>.</p>
</div></Base>
